WEBVTT

00:06.330 --> 00:10.030
Excellent work with your latest victory.

00:10.030 --> 00:13.530
No, the victory belongs
 to the entire 7th Corps.

00:14.080 --> 00:16.680
You're always so humble.

00:16.680 --> 00:18.880
So, for your next mission...

00:18.880 --> 00:21.250
I'd like you to head to Xenobia.

00:21.830 --> 00:23.330
Xenobia?

00:24.100 --> 00:28.290
The humans are likely to launch a full-on 
attack against the demon army at some point.

00:29.330 --> 00:32.760
That's because you defeated the 
Alliance of Kings, of course.

00:32.760 --> 00:35.380
Then we need to come up with a plan.

00:36.870 --> 00:38.970
Is it a problem of supplies?

00:39.320 --> 00:41.420
Yes. Very astute of you.

00:42.050 --> 00:46.160
Thanks to you, the amount of crops 
we're receiving from Ivalias has increased.

00:46.160 --> 00:48.440
But it's not enough to feed the whole army.

00:49.430 --> 00:53.200
We've been running low on food 
since the war intensified.

00:53.200 --> 00:57.590
I want you to talk to the 
Federation about a trade treaty.

00:57.590 --> 01:02.910
Is that an order to speak directly to 
Xenobia, the leader of the Federation?

01:03.450 --> 01:05.000
In my place.

01:05.310 --> 01:07.900
You always give me the impossible jobs.

01:08.740 --> 01:11.460
Will humans agree to negotiate 
with demons directly?

01:11.700 --> 01:14.090
That's why I'm asking you.

01:14.390 --> 01:16.860
But I need to rebuild Ivalias.

01:16.860 --> 01:18.640
I'll handle it.

01:18.640 --> 01:20.960
Don't worry about Ivalias.

01:20.960 --> 01:23.020
Go have a nice trip while you're at it.

02:56.530 --> 03:01.030
<i>Negotiations</i>

03:04.530 --> 03:06.910
T-Trouble!

03:07.290 --> 03:12.300
I heard you're going to Xenobia 
in the south! Is that true?!

03:12.300 --> 03:14.880
You won't be going someplace 
so far away, right?

03:14.880 --> 03:17.080
No, it's true!

03:17.080 --> 03:18.340
I'll be gone for a while.

03:19.590 --> 03:25.140
Then I shall go with you to protect you, 
at the cost of my life if necessary.

03:25.140 --> 03:28.350
Hey, you ugly pig, know your place!

03:28.350 --> 03:30.450
You're calling me ugly again?

03:28.350 --> 03:31.920
It's my job to protect Ike-sama!

03:30.450 --> 03:35.310
Hey. Hey. Hey, I said.

03:31.920 --> 03:35.310
Ike-sama, I'll get ready for our journey!

03:35.310 --> 03:37.900
Why am I not going? I'm his strategist!

03:37.900 --> 03:41.340
You can't do anything without my help!

03:41.340 --> 03:43.910
This time I want you to stay here.

03:44.820 --> 03:46.030
Stay here?

03:46.300 --> 03:49.530
Lately, word of Ivalias has been spreading,

03:49.530 --> 03:51.800
and vagabonds and refugees 
are gathering here.

03:52.320 --> 03:54.300
That means there'll be 
more trouble to deal with.

03:55.010 --> 03:58.380
While I'm gone, I want Lilith 
to keep the city safe.

03:58.380 --> 04:00.800
And Jiron, I want you to manage it.

04:00.800 --> 04:03.270
If I see a human doing bad things,

04:03.270 --> 04:04.870
you want me to punch them as hard as I can,

04:04.870 --> 04:08.080
then beat them up and throw them in jail?

04:08.080 --> 04:11.520
Don't blame me for what happens 
if you leave me behind.

04:11.520 --> 04:13.050
Don't get violent.

04:13.050 --> 04:14.840
I can't do that!

04:14.840 --> 04:18.570
I'm worried if I'll be okay without you.

04:18.570 --> 04:20.990
What if I make a mess of the town?

04:21.370 --> 04:24.120
I've made an instruction manual for you.

04:24.120 --> 04:25.980
Read it if you have trouble.

04:25.980 --> 04:29.120
I'm not sure I can follow it.

04:29.120 --> 04:31.450
No, put some effort in.

04:31.450 --> 04:34.350
I'm not sure I can put in effort without you.

04:34.350 --> 04:39.200
Are you sure I can't put somebody else 
in charge of security and go with you?

04:39.200 --> 04:40.160
Me, too!

04:40.160 --> 04:42.420
I don't think I can manage a city!

04:42.770 --> 04:46.540
This city's on the front lines. 
You're the only people I can leave in charge.

04:47.180 --> 04:48.140
I'm counting on you.

04:49.920 --> 04:50.850
What's your answer?

04:51.220 --> 04:53.830
I'll do my best.

04:56.370 --> 04:57.610
Sheesh.

05:03.230 --> 05:08.320
I'm so lucky to be going on a
 journey alone with you, Master.

05:08.320 --> 05:11.740
I feel bad for Jiron-san 
and Lilith-san, though.

05:11.740 --> 05:17.470
Those two would cause a huge ruckus 
if they knew you were coming with me.

05:17.470 --> 05:18.960
Yes.

05:18.960 --> 05:21.120
She's nowhere to be found!

05:21.120 --> 05:23.070
That brat!

05:23.070 --> 05:25.550
I'll never forgive her!

05:25.990 --> 05:28.460
Ike-sama!

05:31.060 --> 05:32.370
Is something wrong?

05:32.370 --> 05:34.350
No, I just felt a little shiver.

05:35.360 --> 05:40.020
Master, what's Xenobia like?

05:40.410 --> 05:41.590
It's not a country.

05:42.220 --> 05:45.740
It's a trading city to the south. 
Part of the Trade Federation.

05:45.740 --> 05:47.540
Trade Federation?

05:47.540 --> 05:50.620
A group of different cities, basically.

05:51.280 --> 05:54.180
Xenobia is a trade town,

05:54.180 --> 05:58.180
but it also has crops unique to the south

05:58.180 --> 06:00.710
that grow in its warm climate, 
and spices as well.

06:00.710 --> 06:04.710
Which means they have lots 
of fruits and vegetables?

06:04.710 --> 06:07.550
Yes. But that's not all.

06:08.990 --> 06:11.070
Xenobia has everything.

06:11.470 --> 06:12.890
Everything?

06:13.150 --> 06:16.020
Everything that will determine the 
fate of the Demon Lord's army.

06:16.590 --> 06:19.020
And all that depends on 
my negotiating skills.

06:19.610 --> 06:25.280
Um, have the demons and humans 
ever formed a treaty before?

06:25.280 --> 06:26.950
Probably not.

06:26.950 --> 06:29.750
So it won't be easy, right?

06:29.750 --> 06:31.690
That's why I brought you.

06:32.410 --> 06:36.310
To show that humans and demons can get along.

06:38.930 --> 06:43.430
Without food, we'll lose our battle 
with the Alliance of Kings.

06:44.230 --> 06:47.850
Victory for our army depends 
on these negotiations.

07:00.270 --> 07:01.220
Die!

07:02.020 --> 07:04.060
Kill all the men!

07:04.610 --> 07:05.490
It's the Redbeards!

07:05.490 --> 07:06.780
Protect the mistress!

07:07.280 --> 07:08.670
Die!

07:16.000 --> 07:17.080
I'll stop you!

07:22.320 --> 07:23.420
Fools.

07:23.960 --> 07:24.880
Now...

07:25.700 --> 07:27.820
Let's take a look at your face.

07:33.250 --> 07:36.890
I didn't expect such a pretty lady!

07:40.670 --> 07:42.390
What? What happened?!

07:49.170 --> 07:50.480
I've come to save you.

07:50.480 --> 07:51.740
Are you hurt?

07:55.920 --> 07:56.920
<i>Satie?!</i>

07:58.580 --> 07:59.860
<i>No, it can't be.</i>

08:00.320 --> 08:01.830
<i>She looks a lot like her, though.</i>

08:04.290 --> 08:06.400
Hey, who's the kid?

08:06.400 --> 08:07.790
Kill him!

08:08.620 --> 08:09.940
There are more?

08:16.980 --> 08:18.470
Help us!

08:23.040 --> 08:25.100
I-Impossible...

08:25.720 --> 08:28.890
The Redbeard Pirates, defeated so easily?

08:30.510 --> 08:31.840
Please don't move.

08:37.910 --> 08:39.400
Thank you.

08:39.400 --> 08:40.740
It doesn't hurt anymore.

08:41.150 --> 08:43.150
It's not completely healed.

08:43.600 --> 08:45.210
Have a doctor look at it.

08:51.020 --> 08:53.400
You saved our lives.

08:53.400 --> 08:56.470
How can we ever repay you?

08:57.000 --> 08:58.700
Don't worry about it.

08:59.210 --> 09:01.180
I apologize for not introducing myself.

09:02.720 --> 09:06.560
Hello. I'm Yuria Octave.

09:09.410 --> 09:11.530
Daughter of Xenobia's leader.

09:23.310 --> 09:27.660
Thank you so much for saving us.

09:28.830 --> 09:30.310
Not at all.

09:30.310 --> 09:33.300
We appreciate the ride to Xenobia.

09:33.300 --> 09:36.600
Um, you seem to have such 
wonderful magic power

09:36.600 --> 09:39.500
that you were able to capture the Redbeards.

09:39.500 --> 09:41.260
Are you a noble?

09:41.260 --> 09:43.930
I'm a mage from Ismuth.

09:44.870 --> 09:46.450
My name is Ryke.

09:46.450 --> 09:47.440
This is Satie.

09:47.440 --> 09:52.480
I feel like a princess, 
riding in a carriage like this!

09:52.780 --> 09:56.160
Is it your first time riding 
in a carriage, Satie-san?

09:56.160 --> 09:57.750
Um...

09:57.750 --> 09:59.780
Satie is a maid at my family home.

09:59.780 --> 10:01.450
She's had a sheltered upbringing.

10:01.450 --> 10:04.980
I see. I'm the same way.

10:04.980 --> 10:07.410
This is my first time leaving Xenobia.

10:07.690 --> 10:09.370
Some critical errand?

10:09.710 --> 10:14.250
Actually, I met a powerful man 
who I was arranged to marry...

10:14.250 --> 10:16.210
But it didn't work out.

10:16.210 --> 10:19.680
I can't believe there's a man out there 
who would reject a girl like you.

10:20.000 --> 10:23.670
No, I was the one who refused.

10:24.930 --> 10:26.890
And I'm glad I did...

10:41.360 --> 10:42.570
Excuse me.

10:44.180 --> 10:46.290
I've brought the guests.

10:48.340 --> 10:51.750
You're Ryke, the man who 
saved my daughter's life?

10:53.250 --> 10:53.960
Yes.

10:53.960 --> 10:57.120
My name is Eltria Octave.

10:57.120 --> 10:59.420
The leader of the Trade Federation.

10:59.790 --> 11:01.140
<i>This is her, huh?</i>

11:02.210 --> 11:04.510
May I work while we speak?

11:04.510 --> 11:05.580
Go ahead.

11:07.910 --> 11:11.320
I'm sorry. My mother is very busy.

11:11.320 --> 11:15.360
I want to thank you 
properly for saving me, though.

11:15.680 --> 11:16.760
I don't need thanks.

11:17.880 --> 11:19.820
There's no need to trouble yourself.

11:20.790 --> 11:22.780
<i>Eltria Octave.</i>

11:23.220 --> 11:25.700
<i>The leader of the committee 
that runs Xenobia,</i>

11:25.700 --> 11:28.120
<i>and head of the Trade Federation.</i>

11:28.740 --> 11:31.730
<i>She's attained her position 
through talent alone.</i>

11:33.920 --> 11:38.120
<i>I was lucky to run into her daughter 
at just the right time, but...</i>

11:42.450 --> 11:44.990
What are you thinking about?

11:46.600 --> 11:50.270
Yuria, I'm sorry, but could 
you leave us for a moment?

11:50.270 --> 11:52.770
I need to speak to Ryke.

11:52.770 --> 11:54.700
Of course, Mother.

12:04.070 --> 12:06.940
I'm quite busy, so I'll just ask.

12:09.450 --> 12:12.580
What does a member of the 
Demon Lord's army want with me?

12:23.840 --> 12:26.430
Why do you think I'm part 
of the Demon Lord's army?

12:26.430 --> 12:30.390
There is no mage named Ryke in Ismuth.

12:32.350 --> 12:39.270
And my daughter and the guards have 
told me you're a powerful spell caster.

12:39.890 --> 12:43.880
At a time when the Alliance of Kings 
is battling the Demon Lord's army,

12:43.880 --> 12:49.580
a powerful mage like you has 
come here, lying about his origins.

12:50.080 --> 12:52.780
A bit of thought and the answer is obvious.

12:52.780 --> 12:53.910
I see.

12:54.800 --> 12:56.370
And intuition too, I suppose.

12:56.610 --> 12:57.390
Intuition?

12:57.960 --> 13:01.460
It's odd to see a human in the 
Demon Lord's army, though.

13:01.460 --> 13:04.320
I'm Ike, the ruler of Ivalias.

13:04.320 --> 13:06.080
You're the ruler of Ivalias?

13:06.560 --> 13:07.970
I've heard the rumors.

13:08.240 --> 13:11.200
As you say, I'm human.

13:11.200 --> 13:13.060
But I'm also a demon.

13:13.520 --> 13:18.670
Does that mean you've completely 
switched to their side?

13:18.670 --> 13:19.520
No.

13:19.930 --> 13:21.740
My parents were human,

13:22.210 --> 13:27.240
but I was raised by Romberg, 
the Undying King, as a demon.

13:28.940 --> 13:31.330
And what does a demon want with me?

13:31.720 --> 13:36.460
The Demon Lord's army wishes to 
sign a trade treaty with you.

13:36.460 --> 13:39.320
A trade treaty with the Demon Lord's army?

13:39.840 --> 13:42.110
I've never heard of such a thing.

13:42.110 --> 13:42.800
And...

13:44.800 --> 13:48.260
Don't you intend to destroy humanity?

13:50.880 --> 13:55.630
Trading with you would be a big risk.

13:56.170 --> 13:58.420
Perhaps in the past.

13:58.420 --> 13:59.820
But not now.

14:00.520 --> 14:02.480
The reason I'm fighting

14:03.080 --> 14:05.940
is to bring about co-existence 
between humans and demons.

14:06.980 --> 14:09.340
Co-existence between humans and demons?

14:11.180 --> 14:16.650
It's true that they say the current 
Demon King is different than the others.

14:17.650 --> 14:20.960
Still, demons are still demons.

14:20.960 --> 14:22.840
There's no telling when 
you'll change your ways.

14:22.840 --> 14:24.840
That's not true.

14:24.840 --> 14:26.380
Do you have proof?

14:26.940 --> 14:27.850
I do not.

14:28.360 --> 14:31.470
Then there's nothing left to discuss.

14:32.080 --> 14:34.080
Anything to say before you leave?

14:34.950 --> 14:40.310
I've heard that pirates have been giving the 
Trade Federation quite a bit of trouble lately.

14:41.760 --> 14:44.320
Carossa, and his Redbeard Pirates, was it?

14:45.000 --> 14:47.240
That's a problem I can solve.

14:48.240 --> 14:50.500
The Demon Lord's army will go pirate-hunting?

14:50.500 --> 14:51.330
Yes.

14:51.330 --> 14:55.850
It's true that Xenobia has our 
hands full dealing with them.

14:55.850 --> 15:00.210
The damage they cause is equal to
 the annual budget of an entire city.

15:00.780 --> 15:04.530
And if we don't stop them, 
the amount will only increase.

15:04.530 --> 15:07.670
My role as leader of the 
Federation may be in danger.

15:08.770 --> 15:12.140
All right. I'll consider it.

15:12.480 --> 15:14.010
But I have conditions.

15:14.460 --> 15:17.820
First, you get rid of the 
pirates, as you said.

15:18.670 --> 15:20.070
And secondly...

15:21.540 --> 15:24.310
You're going to have to 
marry my daughter, Yuria.

15:25.190 --> 15:28.280
Huh? What do you mean?

15:28.280 --> 15:30.000
Just what I said.

15:30.000 --> 15:32.740
I'm a human, but I'm part 
of the Demon Lord's army.

15:33.290 --> 15:37.950
I'm Yuria's mother, but also the 
leader of the Trade Federation.

15:37.950 --> 15:40.800
You're smart, and loyal.

15:40.800 --> 15:44.320
I expect you'll be one of the leaders 
of the Demon Lord's army someday.

15:44.320 --> 15:47.420
It's a good idea to build 
a relationship with you.

15:47.420 --> 15:49.190
Is that your intuition, too?

15:49.190 --> 15:52.880
Of course. My intuition is always accurate.

15:56.320 --> 15:57.540
Eltria-sama!

15:57.540 --> 16:01.060
The Redbeard Pirates are attacking the port!

16:07.110 --> 16:10.640
Grab the food and load 
the women onto the ship!

16:10.640 --> 16:11.920
We don't need anybody else!

16:11.920 --> 16:12.530
Kill them!

16:12.790 --> 16:14.610
Kill them all!

16:15.750 --> 16:17.830
Escape into the town!

16:25.860 --> 16:29.130
I warned you.

16:33.390 --> 16:36.050
Carossa, you bastard...

16:36.050 --> 16:37.560
You leave me no choice.

16:37.560 --> 16:40.270
Crush anybody who doesn't submit!

16:41.710 --> 16:43.600
It seems there's little time.

16:45.690 --> 16:48.770
Will you accept my conditions, Ike?

16:49.660 --> 16:51.110
What's your answer?

17:01.870 --> 17:03.690
We were a step too late, huh?

17:05.360 --> 17:06.080
Over there!

17:14.680 --> 17:15.640
Are you all right?

17:15.640 --> 17:18.390
Yes. Thank you.

17:18.850 --> 17:20.480
What happened?

17:20.480 --> 17:24.100
They were after the cargo for that ship,
 which was to set sail today.

17:24.710 --> 17:26.010
How many pirates were there?

17:26.010 --> 17:27.560
One ship.

17:27.940 --> 17:29.670
Less than I expected.

17:29.670 --> 17:30.350
Yes.

17:30.350 --> 17:33.140
But you mustn't underestimate them.

17:33.140 --> 17:36.200
Their leader, Carossa, is a mage.

17:36.200 --> 17:39.680
He attacks when we least expect him!

17:42.330 --> 17:44.700
If we could at least find him...

17:47.330 --> 17:51.950
We'll wait for their next attack 
and launch a counterattack.

17:52.680 --> 17:55.640
Please prepare the men 
and weapons we'll need.

17:55.640 --> 17:56.300
All right.

18:03.200 --> 18:04.720
Master...

18:05.010 --> 18:09.940
I don't think I'm going 
to be of any use here,

18:09.940 --> 18:12.500
so I'm going to go help prepare the meals.

18:12.500 --> 18:15.120
Yeah. I'm sure you're 
tired from your journey.

18:15.120 --> 18:16.160
Don't push yourself too hard.

18:16.160 --> 18:17.020
Okay!

18:21.860 --> 18:23.080
Um...

18:23.080 --> 18:25.380
Yes? Oh, Mistress Yuria!

18:25.380 --> 18:29.620
No, I'm just a guest who came with Ryke-sama.

18:29.620 --> 18:33.010
Oh, my. You're the spitting image of her.

18:33.010 --> 18:38.090
I'd love to have your help, 
but if we let a guest help

18:38.420 --> 18:41.200
we'd be scolded later.

18:41.820 --> 18:43.560
I see.

18:46.890 --> 18:49.520
Um, Ryke-sama?

18:50.240 --> 18:51.190
Yuria-sama?

18:52.000 --> 18:53.860
May we speak for a moment?

18:54.350 --> 18:55.030
Yes.

18:57.520 --> 19:00.030
What did you want to talk about?

19:01.270 --> 19:03.950
My marriage to you...

19:03.950 --> 19:07.020
Oh, um... I'm sure it's a bother,

19:07.020 --> 19:09.240
having this marriage talk 
come out of nowhere.

19:09.240 --> 19:11.170
I'll persuade her...

19:11.470 --> 19:13.170
I'm elated!

19:15.700 --> 19:17.600
I fell in love with you at first sight!

19:17.600 --> 19:20.330
Please be my husband!

19:20.330 --> 19:20.840
Huh?

19:21.280 --> 19:23.090
I'm serious!

19:24.180 --> 19:26.630
We've known each other 
for less than 12 hours!

19:26.630 --> 19:28.560
You don't know a thing about me!

19:29.380 --> 19:32.620
So you don't like me, do you?

19:32.620 --> 19:34.270
No, that's not true...

19:35.120 --> 19:37.790
I'm sorry. I'm bothering you.

19:38.230 --> 19:41.630
No, it's just so sudden, 
I don't know what to say.

19:41.630 --> 19:44.610
<i>Wow, nobles are amazing.</i>

19:44.610 --> 19:47.740
<i>She's proposing when they've just met.</i>

19:48.230 --> 19:49.370
<i>But...</i>

19:48.230 --> 19:51.830
Listen to me. We need to 
take our time with this.

19:50.400 --> 19:51.830
<i>for some reason...</i>

19:52.290 --> 19:54.790
<i>I feel so strange.</i>

19:56.730 --> 19:58.020
Excuse me a moment.

20:11.830 --> 20:16.480
<i>All I can do is look for ingredients 
that will make Ike-sama happy!</i>

20:17.410 --> 20:18.750
Because I'm...

20:20.450 --> 20:22.450
his servant!

20:30.620 --> 20:32.020
That girl...

20:56.440 --> 20:59.140
This is the girl the 
captain was talking about?

20:59.140 --> 21:00.650
Hey, out of the way!

21:00.650 --> 21:02.790
She's a gift for the captain!

21:02.790 --> 21:05.110
What? You don't get to cut in line.

21:05.110 --> 21:07.120
Shut up and leave!

21:07.120 --> 21:08.330
Asshole.

21:09.770 --> 21:13.170
I'm sure the captain will be satisfied.

21:13.170 --> 21:17.040
She's the daughter of 
Xenobia's leader, after all.

21:17.040 --> 21:20.750
<i>They think I'm Yuria-san?</i>

21:21.190 --> 21:25.320
Maybe I'll get to be vice-captain.

21:29.850 --> 21:30.870
Damn it!

21:31.390 --> 21:34.060
Master! I'm right here!

21:34.060 --> 21:35.720
Master!

21:45.920 --> 21:48.380
Huh? Where am I?

23:34.220 --> 23:38.850
<i>Pirates</i>
